<span class="">Alerte Urgence (Expire ce soir)</span>
</button>
<button class="state-tab-btn px-space-md py-space-xs rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold bg-surface-container text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high" id="stateBtn-denied" onclick="switchStateTab('denied')" type="button">
